tegration","Description":"Kết nối Plane (projects/issues/members), chuẩn hóa dữ liệu cho RAG.","Owner":"Backend","Start_Date":"2024-10-03","End_Date":"2024-10-10","Dependencies":"3.1","Deliverable":"Plane client + data normalizer"},{"WBS":3.3,"Task":"Assignment Automation","Description":"Xây dựng logic auto-assign, mapping intent → hành động Plane.","Owner":"Backend","Start_Date":"2024-10-11","End_Date":"2024-10-17","Dependencies":"3.2","Deliverable":"Assignment service"},{"WBS":3.4,"Task":"Frontend Chat & Admin","Description":"UI cho chatbot và trang cấu hình (key, workspace, prompts).","Owner":"Frontend","Start_Date":"2024-10-11","End_Date":"2024-10-20","Dependencies":"3.1","Deliverable":"Chat UI + admin screens"},{"WBS":4.0,"Task":"Quality & UAT","Description":"Đảm bảo chất lượng và nghiệm thu.","Owner":"QA","Start_Date":"2024-10-21","End_Date":"2024-10-29","Dependencies":"3.2;3.3;3.4","Deliverable":"Test report, UAT signoff"},{"WBS":4.1,"Task":"Test Plan & Automation","Description":"Viết test plan, bổ sung unit/integration tests, smoke UAT.","Owner":"QA","Start_Date":"2024-10-21","End_Date":"2024-10-25","Dependencies":"3.2;3.3","Deliverable":"Test suites & results"},{"WBS":4.2,"Task":"UAT & Bugfix","Description":"Chạy UAT với stakeholder, fix lỗi ưu tiên cao.","Owner":"QA","Start_Date":"2024-10-26","End_Date":"2024-10-29","Dependencies":"4.1","Deliverable":"UAT signoff"},{"WBS":5.0,"Task":"Deployment & Handover","Description":"Triển khai production và bàn giao vận hành.","Owner":"DevOps","Start_Date":"2024-10-30","End_Date":"2024-11-01","Dependencies":"4.2","Deliverable":"Prod release, runbook, training"},{"WBS":5.1,"Task":"Production Deployment","Description":"Chuẩn bị infra, secrets, release cut, kiểm tra sau triển khai.","Owner":"DevOps","Start_Date":"2024-10-30","End_Date":"2024-10-31","Dependencies":"5.0","Deliverable":"Live system"},{"WBS":5.2,"Task":"Training & Runbook","Description":"Đào tạo đội vận hành, bàn giao tài liệu, checklist support.","Owner":"P